    "description": "\ud83e\udddf <b>GOT BRAINS? </b>\r\n\r\nEveryone\u2019s worst nightmare has come true: things have gone nuclear, and the zombie apocalypse has arrived! With survivors few and far between, you\u2019ll need to navigate between driving back the walking dead, building strongholds and bases, crafting supplies, and just plain survival! This idle simulator has it all, from the thrill of bashing in zombie heads to collecting resources.\r\n\r\n\ud83e\udde0<b>BRAINS OVER BRAWN</b>\r\n\r\nStart off by building a base that you can take refuge in, then venture out to take out these zombies, stalker style! Don\u2019t forget about defense though \u2013 your survival depends on making friends with the other humans and adding them to your team so that someone always has your back. Together you\u2019ll be able to craft, explore, and kick zombie butt till the cows come home!\r\n\r\nFun Features:\r\n\r\n\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0fZombies Galore: As a lucky survivor, you\u2019ve been thrust into a nightmarish world where the walking dead roam the land in overwhelming numbers. Armed with limited resources and unyielding determination, navigate the treacherous post-apocalyptic landscapes and fend off hordes of undead to both stay alive and defend your base. The sheer volume of zombies to kill ensures that you\u2019ll get to experience both offense and defense in this exciting test of strategy and survival instincts.\r\n\r\n\ud83e\ude93Get Crafty: As you navigate the simulator, you\u2019ll have the chance to collect all sorts of resources that will come in handy for constructing buildings, healing yourself and team members, and driving out the zombie hordes. Thanks to the idle aspect of this game you\u2019ll be able to take some breathers from the chaos and just focus on gathering items and stockpiling resources.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\ude97Explore Some More: The world is your oyster, the only thing keeping you from sitting back to enjoy it are all these zombies! In driving them from their hideouts, you\u2019ll get to explore tons of great locations and neat areas, as well as build various strongholds in them. Different locations offer up different resources too, so keep your eyes peeled for these and more as you explore.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd2aGreat Storyline: This simulator was created with an open-ended storyline that just keeps evolving, meaning there are always fun new locations, and not so fun new zombies that want to eat your brains. Survival doesn\u2019t have to be boring!\r\n\r\n<b>WILL YOU SINK OR SWIM?</b>\ud83d\udc80\r\n\r\nWith the ability to build and defend strongholds, craft supplies, and form alliances with other survivors, every moment of survival is packed with both excitement and strategy. \r\n\r\n<u>Download Last Stronghold today to dive into this exhilarating idle simulator and see if you\u2019ve got both the brains and the brawn needed to survive the zombie apocalypse and rebuild society!</u>\r\n\r\nOnly the toughest can make it through \u2013 can you?\r\n\r\nPrivacy Policy:\u00a0https://say.games/privacy-policy\r\nTerms of Use:\u00a0https://say.games/terms-of-use",
